  "body": "`federationhttpclient` has a bunch of logic to retry requests, but it only fires for connection failures, 429 responses, and (optionally) dns lookup errors. Why don't we retry on 5xx errors?\r\n\r\n(For example: we sometimes see 520 errors from matrix.org. Arguably that's indicative of a problem, but I think we could be robust to it.)",
